⚠ Direct push detected (not via 'shipyard pr').
   Local validation gates (skill-sync, version-bump, source-contract, diff-cover,
   build/test on macOS+Ubuntu+Windows VMs) get skipped, so CI becomes the discovery channel.

   Acceptable temporary fallbacks:
   - GraphQL rate limit (run: gh api rate_limit --jq .resources.graphql)
   - shipyard tool error (file issue at danielraffel/shipyard-cli, link in PR)
   - SSH host unreachable (use shipyard pr --skip-target NAME instead)

   To return to shipyard pr: just run it on the next PR.
   To suppress this warning when intentionally using direct push:
     PULP_VIA_SHIPYARD=1 git push   # marks this push as supervised

